<div class="section">
    <h3>Introduction</h3>
    <p>This is the documentation for the Harry Potter Documentation API. You can get information on characters, potions, spells, and houses. All responses are in JSON format.</p>
</div>
<div class="divider"></div>
<div class="section">
    <h3>Routes</h3>
    <p>All API requests should start with http://asjdkjflfsafd.com/api.</p>
</div>
<div class="divider"></div>
<div class="section">
    <h4>Characters</h4>
    <blockquote>
        <code>GET /characters</code>
    </blockquote>
    <p>Returns a list of all characters. Can be narrowed down by query parameters listed below.</p>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <td>Parameter</td>
                <td>Value</td>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>name</td>
                <td>Any</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>gender</td>
                <td>male, female, unknown</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>birth</td>
                <td>Any</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>death</td>
                <td>Any</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>job</td>
                <td>Any</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>house</td>
                <td>gryffindor, slytherin, hufflepuff, ravenclaw</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>wand</td>
                <td>Any</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>patronus</td>
                <td>Any</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>species</td>
                <td>human, ghost, etc.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>blood Status</td>
                <td>pure, half, muggle</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>hairColor</td>
                <td>Any</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>eyeColor</td>
                <td>Any</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>loyalty</td>
                <td>Any</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>skills</td>
                <td>Any</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>
<div class="divider"></div>
<div class="section">
    <h4>Potions</h4>
    <blockquote>
        <code>GET /potions</code>
    </blockquote>
    <p>Returns a list of all potions. Can be narrowed down by query parameters listed below.</p>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <td>Parameter</td>
                <td>Value</td>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>name</td>
                <td>Any</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>knownIngredients</td>
                <td>Any</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>effect</td>
                <td>Any</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>characteristsics</td>
                <td>Any</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>difficultyLevel</td>
                <td>Any</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>
<div class="divider"></div>
<div class="section">
    <h4>Spells</h4>
    <blockquote>
        <code>GET /spells</code>
    </blockquote>
    <p>Returns a list of all spells. Can be narrowed down by query parameters listed below.</p>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <td>Parameter</td>
                <td>Value</td>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>name</td>
                <td>Any</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>incantation</td>
                <td>Any</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>type</td>
                <td>spell, charm, jinx, hex, curse, counter, healing</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>effect</td>
                <td>Any</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>light</td>
                <td>Any</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>